<Base title="CV · Panagiotis Promponas" description="Curriculum vitae of Panagiotis Promponas.">
  <section class="wrap page-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Curriculum vitae</div>
    <h1>Panagiotis Promponas</h1>
    <p class="lead">Ph.D. candidate in Electrical and Computer Engineering at Yale University, advised by Leandros Tassiulas.</p>
    <div class="intro-body"><p>I am from Naxos, Greece. Before Yale I earned a five-year diploma in Electrical and Computer Engineering from the National Technical University of Athens, with a thesis on uplink power control advised by Symeon Papavassiliou, and stayed on as a research assistant working on game-theoretic network problems. Along the way I interned with Cisco Systems on compilers for distributed quantum computing and with Amazon on large-scale logistics optimization.</p></div>
    <div class="cv-actions">
      <a class="btn" href="/cv/Panos_Promponas_CV.pdf">Full CV with publications (PDF)</a>
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:panagiotis.promponas@yale.edu">Email</a>
    </div>
  </section>

