    <div class="cv-item">
      <div class="cv-when">Aug 2020 to Dec 2026, expected</div>
      <div class="cv-what">
        <strong>Ph.D. in Electrical &amp; Computer Engineering</strong>
        <span class="where">Yale University, New Haven, CT. Advisor: <a href="https://engineering.yale.edu/research-and-faculty/faculty-directory/leandros-tassiulas">Leandros Tassiulas</a>. M.S. and M.Phil. in Electrical &amp; Computer Engineering en route.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cv-item">
      <div class="cv-when">2013 to 2019</div>
      <div class="cv-what">
